        {
          "id": "25cdb32f-467e-39aa-b7b9-16052f0b06be",
          "content": {
            "id": "25cdb32f-467e-39aa-b7b9-16052f0b06be",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "BMW appoints Milan Nedeljkovic as CEO to replace Oliver Zipse",
            "description": "<title><body><p>STORY: BMW has a new CEO.</p><p>The German auto giant's supervisory board announced Tuesday (December 9) Milan Nedeljkovic will take over from May next year.</p><p>He'll replace current head Oliver Zipse, who will resign before Nedeljkovic takes charge.</p><p>BMW said Nedeljkovic is 56 year-old and currently head of production.</p><p>It added he's worked with the carmaker for more than 30 years.</p><p>BMW is gearing up to launch a new range of models in a competitive market.</p><p>Nedeljkovic will head a carmaker fighting against tough competition from China and high U.S. tariffs.</p><p>Those challenges saw the luxury carmaker cut its earnings forecast for the year in October.</p><p>It is also betting on the first model from the all-electric \"Neue Klasse\" series to drive growth next year.</p></body></title>",
            "summary": "<body><p>STORY: BMW has a new CEO.</p><p>The German auto giant's supervisory board announced Tuesday (December 9) Milan Nedeljkovic will take over from May next year.</p><p>He'll replace current head Oliver Zipse, who will resign before Nedeljkovic takes charge.</p><p>BMW said Nedeljkovic is 56 year-old and currently head of production.</p><p>It added he's worked with the carmaker for more than 30 years.</p><p>BMW is gearing up to launch a new range of models in a competitive market.</p><p>Nedeljkovic will head a carmaker fighting against tough competition from China and high U.S. tariffs.</p><p>Those challenges saw the luxury carmaker cut its earnings forecast for the year in October.</p><p>It is also betting on the first model from the all-electric \"Neue Klasse\" series to drive growth next year.</p></body>",
